<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76204" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆος</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything used for holding</i> or <i>fastening</i>:
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>band</i> or <i>strap for fastening the helmet</i> under the
			chin, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.372
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl.,
				<i>fastenings</i> or <i>clasps of the belt</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅθι ζωστῆρος ὀχῆες χρύσειοι σύνεχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.132
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				20.414
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bolt</i> or <i>bar</i> of a door, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικεκλιμένας σανίδας καὶ μακρὸν ὀχῆα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.121
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρέων δ᾽ ἀνέκοπτεν ὀχῆας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.47
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.49
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. θύρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.280
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; <i>bolts</i> holding the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκῶνες</span> in place in a war-engine, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				72.31
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῶν . . ὀχῆας</span> ships'
				<i>rudders</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				4.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχῆες τῆς ὑστέρης,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχοι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.11
			</span></i> (vv. ll. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσχιες, ὄχιες</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχανον, οἱ ὀ. οἱ
				σκύτινοι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				18.18.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>axle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαίρης ἥ τ᾽ ἀμφὶς ὀχῆος ἀεὶ
					περιτέλλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					247.25
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
